      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Ruu: Kapatcir",
      "content": "Kapatcir is the Thunderbird of Mt. Kanna, the local deity of Tsurumi who paid the islanders no mind until Ruu's singing drew her. He named her Kanna Kapatcir and they promised to meet again. When she returned and found his blood on the sacrificial altar, she destroyed the village and cursed the island to relive its end. Later she was slain by the Raiden Shogun, though a Thunder Manifestation remains. Her curse is lifted when Ruu sings for her again.",
